{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Bio enrollment operations bound to a PIN\/UV auth token."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"BioEnrollment","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Allows managing fingerprint enrollments on biometric authenticators (e.g., YubiKey Bio).","type":"text"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/fidoalliance.org\/specs\/fido-v2.2-ps-20250714\/fido-client-to-authenticator-protocol-v2.2-ps-20250714.html#authenticatorBioEnrollment","type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"See Also"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Fingerprint enrollment operations for biometric authenticators (e.g., YubiKey Bio).","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"BioEnrollment manages fingerprint enrollments on biometric authenticators. It requires a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"PIN\/UV auth token with the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/ClientPin\/Permission\/bioEnrollment","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" permission.","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["let token = try await session.getPinUVToken(","    using: .pin(\"123456\"),","    permissions: [.bioEnrollment]",")","let bio = try await session.bioEnrollment(token: token)","","\/\/ Check sensor capabilities","let sensorInfo = try await bio.getFingerprintSensorInfo()","","\/\/ Enroll a new fingerprint","for try await sample in bio.enroll(timeout: 10000) {","    switch sample {","    case .waitingForUser:","        print(\"Touch the sensor...\")","    case .sample(let status, let remaining):","        print(\"Captured: \\(status), \\(remaining) remaining\")","    case .completed(let templateId, _):","        print(\"Enrollment complete!\")","    }","}","","\/\/ List existing enrollments","for try await enrollment in bio.enrollments {","    print(\"\\(enrollment.templateId): \\(enrollment.friendlyName ?? \"unnamed\")\")","}"],"type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/BioEnrollment"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Feature-Detection","title":"Feature Detection","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/BioEnrollment\/isSupported(by:)"]},{"anchor":"Sensor-Information","title":"Sensor Information","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/BioEnrollment\/getFingerprintSensorInfo()"]},{"anchor":"Enrollment-Operations","title":"Enrollment Operations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/BioEnrollment\/enroll(timeout:)","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/BioEnrollment\/cancelEnrollment()"]},{"anchor":"Managing-Enrollments","title":"Managing Enrollments","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/BioEnrollment\/enrollments","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/BioEnrollment\/setFriendlyName(_:for:)","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/BioEnrollment\/removeEnrollment(_:)"]},{"anchor":"Related-Types","title":"Related Types","identifiers":["doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/BioEnrollment\/FingerprintSensorInfo","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/BioEnrollment\/FingerprintKind","doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/CTAP2\/BioEnrollment\/SampleStatus"